  "description": "Prejudice, fear, or hatred directed at Muslims or those perceived to be Muslim. The meme implicitly references Islamophobia by associating suicide bombing with a 'wife' (a gendered and culturally specific trope often used in anti-Muslim rhetoric), thereby reinforcing harmful stereotypes that link terrorism to Islam. This requires understanding of real-world anti-Muslim bias and its manifestations.",
